{"author":{"id":"2f242a7e7f2592f8909954a77fabece74f6e8cc197182647ed3b15ea8e3878af"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1790962304,"nonce":"tIj5oWkib44EnEJpJz5Hlts7wz8=","title":"winit window operations the API does not have","message":"The declaration covers what cb_window had and more, but not all of winit 0.30's `Window`: the window icon (`set_window_icon`, `with_window_icon`), a theme override (`set_theme`), resize increments, `drag_window` and `drag_resize_window` for undecorated windows, `show_window_menu`, `set_enabled_buttons`, `set_cursor_hittest`, the IME purpose, `inner_position`, and monitors' video modes. Each needs a declaration entry, a native implementation, and a web one or a no-op.","files":null}]}